                                "sense_id": "df589e61-8fcc-3ea4-9ca7-7551e05b3be3",
                                "text": "Horace Walpole, in a short essay, distinguished by his usual accuracy of information, and ornamented by his wit and taste, has traced the history of gardening, in a pictural sense, from the mere art of horticulture to the creation of scenery of a more general character, extending beyond the narrow limits of the proper garden and orchard."
